      "name": "KRISS Vector .308 assault rifle",
      "slug": "kriss-vector-308-assault-rifle",
      "teaser": "Fictional assault rifle inspired by Rainbow Six: Siege.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1160.png",
      "downloads": 11802,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>My earlier work.</p>\n<p>Who wouldn’t want to own a KRISS Vector that fires .308?</p>\n<p>Includes:</p>\n<p>Two barrels: 11-inch standard, 185mm short</p>\n<p>Two magazines: 10-round single stack magazine, 50-round drum magazine, 20-round magazine(1.1.0)</p>\n<h3><strong>Installion:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Just like other mods. Unzip and drop Mass_V308 folder into “[Your EFT Directory]/user/mods”.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>You should be able to find it and its parts in Mechanic’s shop and on the flea market.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Feel free to drop your errors into the comments.</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>Known Issue:</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Due to it’s nature of mesh stretched KRISS Vector, the gun’s shading in some place may look a bit strange.</strong></p>\n",
